WEBVTT

00:12:59.771 --> 00:13:02.940
i onda otpevam bluz pesmu,

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:10.544
koja - (Aplauz) -

00:13:10.544 --> 00:13:13.767
se zove "Ponovo pokraden,"

00:13:13.767 --> 00:13:16.425
i tražim od publike da mi budu
pomoćni vokali,

00:13:16.425 --> 00:13:20.405
i kažem im, "Vaš tekst je "Krađa, krađa."

00:13:20.405 --> 00:13:23.050
Zvuči ovako : "Krađa, krađa"

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:24.013
Ide ovako.

00:13:24.013 --> 00:13:26.232
♪ Ponovo sam pokraden ♪

00:13:26.232 --> 00:13:27.975
♪ Krađa, krađa! ♪

00:13:27.975 --> 00:13:29.253
I onda krenemo.

00:13:29.253 --> 00:13:31.298
♪ Ponovo sam pokraden ♪